  "known_boundaries": [
    "Majiro RCT original CRC32/password-to-derived-XOR cipher is implemented through ctx.key(\"majiro/rct\"). Passwords are caller-provided raw bytes, not guessed encodings or bundled game keys; unavailable client keys fail. The encrypted branch is behavior-tested with an independent synthetic ciphertext, not an external game-key fixture.",
    "YKG supports the same unencrypted reversed-PNG form as pinned upstream; encrypted/non-PNG forms explicitly fail.",
